{%- comment -%}
  SYNOR Diaries — FIELD LOG.

  Chhapa ma khune havaman nu khanu hoy chhe. Aa e j jagya chhe, pan andar
  havaman nahi — e dispatch nu havaman. Perfume kharekhar bhej ane taapman
  pramane badlaay chhe, etle aa aankda dekhadva e content chhe, sajavat nahi.

  Aankda metafields ma thi aave chhe (tags ma nahi — chha aankda tag tarike
  lakhva gandu kaam chhe). Je metafield khali hoy e khanu aavtu j nathi, etle
  guide post par aakhu field log chhupai jaay — tya eni jarur nathi.

  METAFIELDS (namespace `custom`):
    field_place · field_alt · field_temp · field_humidity · field_held · field_asked

  Vaapar:
    {% render 'sa-blog-field', article: article, keys: 'temp,humidity,asked' %}
    {% render 'sa-blog-field', article: article %}   ← chhaey

  Labels angreji ma j rakhya chhe, section setting tarike nahi: e chhapa nu
  sarjaam chhe (jem "TEMP", "HUMIDITY"), ane chha label × be section = bar
  settings, je koi kadi badalse nahi.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign f_place = article.metafields.custom.field_place.value
  assign f_alt = article.metafields.custom.field_alt.value
  assign f_temp = article.metafields.custom.field_temp.value
  assign f_hum = article.metafields.custom.field_humidity.value
  assign f_held = article.metafields.custom.field_held.value
  assign f_asked = article.metafields.custom.field_asked.value

  assign want = keys | default: 'place,alt,temp,humidity,held,asked' | split: ','
-%}

{%- capture cells -%}
  {%- for k in want -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign lab = ''
      assign val = ''
      case k
        when 'place'
          assign lab = 'Place'
          assign val = f_place
        when 'alt'
          assign lab = 'Altitude'
          assign val = f_alt
        when 'temp'
          assign lab = 'Temp'
          assign val = f_temp
        when 'humidity'
          assign lab = 'Humidity'
          assign val = f_hum
        when 'held'
          assign lab = 'Held'
          assign val = f_held
        when 'asked'
          assign lab = 'Asked'
          assign val = f_asked
      endcase
    -%}
    {%- if val != blank -%}
      <div><b>{{ lab }}</b><s>{{ val }}</s></div>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{%- assign cells_t = cells | strip -%}
{%- if cells_t != blank -%}
  <div class="nfield">{{ cells }}</div>
{%- endif -%}
